    "summary": "Bearer: a **WORLD EATERS** model.\n\nAs [your Shooting phase](vsdata:core-rule/shooting-phase) begins, you can pick a **VEHICLE** model up to 6\" from the bearer or, while the bearer is embarked in a **TRANSPORT**, that **TRANSPORT** model. After the picked model has shot in this phase, pick an enemy unit that any of those attacks hit. That unit is suppressed until your next turn begins: while suppressed, its models' attacks get -1 to [Hit](vsdata:core-rule/hit-rolls).",
